// dyn-u64(42) - dyn-u64(0) = 42
// The subtrahend is a dynamic zero (MLOAD round-trip), so it does NOT take the
// const zero-identity shortcut; it exercises the range-based u64 fast path.
// Push b = 0 first, then a = 42; SUB computes a - b.
PUSH1 0x00
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x00
MLOAD
PUSH8 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
AND
PUSH1 0x2a
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x00
MLOAD
PUSH8 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
AND
SUB
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x20
PUSH1 0x00
RETURN
